nato\" (character): ✅ Passed to LLM validation as expected\n\n### ✅ Phase 5: Documentation & Commit\n- Updated EVALUATION_STATE.md with root cause, smoke test results, and next action\n- Committed fix with detailed message (commit 8aebebc)\n- Phase set to `awaiting_analysis`\n\n### 📊 Expected Impact\n- **Addresses:** Issue #1 (Amontillado as character) - should improve Character Extraction score\n- **Downstream fixes:** Issues #3 and #5 should auto-resolve when Amontillado is removed\n- **Not addressed:** Issue #2 (Montresor narrator) and #4 (Luchresi missing) - require separate fixes\n\nThe oracle loop will now re-run analysis to verify the fix worked and measure the score improvement."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":348,"cache_read_input_tokens":66409,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":348,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc752f08-a97e-414a-80a9-5ebecf4f174b","uuid":"265cd0bb-7ddf-4422-b5cb-178739f01b60"}
